# GitHub Linguist tuning for the publish repo.
#
# The .NET implementation at the repo root is the only release-tracked
# CA server. The five language ports under example/ are reference reads
# reference reads carried forward for compatibility and not maintained or built. They
# also happen to dominate the byte count, so without this file GitHub
# shows the repo's primary language as Java (Spring Boot is verbose) —
# which is wrong.
#
# linguist-vendored excludes these files from BOTH the language summary
# bar at the top of the repo page AND diff highlighting; they still show
# up in `git log` and search.

example/**                    linguist-vendored=true
example/*/Dockerfile          linguist-vendored=true
example/*/docker-compose.yml  linguist-vendored=true
